ration.py-511-    \"\"\"Run (or resume/refresh) the fixed five-operation split recipe for\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-512-    `project` against `backend`, persisting durable checkpoints into the\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-513-    `.vgt` sidecar as each operation progresses.\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-514-\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-515-    Idempotent and safe to interrupt: unchanged source bytes and unchanged\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-516-    per-operation specs leave completed operations untouched (`force`\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-517-    recomputes every operation regardless of cache, but a paid recompute is\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-518-    still gated by the caller -- this function does not itself decide\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-519-    whether spending is acceptable, matching the plan's `--force` vs\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-520-    `--force-stems` split, which is CLI-layer (issue C)).\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-521-    \"\"\"\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-522-    emit = progress or (lambda _message: None)\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-523-    project_path = locate_project(project)\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-524-    try:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-525-        sidecar = read_sidecar(project_path)\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-526-    except SidecarError as exc:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-527-        raise SeparationError(str(exc)) from exc\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-528-\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-529-    try:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-530-        source = reference_source_path(project_path, sidecar)\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-531-    except ProjectError as exc:\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-532-        raise SeparationError(str(exc)) from exc\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-533-    if not source.is_file():\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-534-        raise SeparationError(f\"Reference source file not found: {source}\")\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-535-\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-536-    stems = sidecar[\"analysis\"][\"stems\"]\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-537-    resolved_guitar_type = guitar_type or stems.get(\"guitar_type\") or \"electric\"\nsrc/vgt/separation.py-538-    if resolv